Server init.
>> a := Blob nĳ: 4.
a bytes: ( Rige nĳ ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob nĳ: 4.
b bytes: ( Rige nĳ ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a nĳ.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Utfier skriuwe: ( a ^ c ), nije-rigel. } fange: { :e Utfier skriuwe: e, nije-rigel. }, begjinne.
a frijjaan.
b frijjaan.
